  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Barbarea verna",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbarea_verna",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1373600435,
      "text": "Barbarea verna is a biennial herb in the family Brassicaceae. Common names include land cress, American cress, bank cress, black wood cress, Belle Isle cress, Bermuda cress, poor man's cabbage, early yellowrocket, early wintercress, scurvy cress, creasy greens, and upland cress. It is native to southern Europe and western Asia, and naturalized elsewhere It has been cultivated as a leaf vegetable in England since the 17th century. As it requires less water than watercress, it is easier to cultivate."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Barbarea verna",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbarea_verna",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 174574001,
      "text": "Barbarea verna es una especie de planta herbácea bienal perteneciente a la familia Brassicaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Barbarea verna",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbarea_verna",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 229477143,
      "text": "Barbarea verna, le cresson de terre, le cresson de jardin ou la barbarée printanière, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Brassicaceae. C'est une plante herbacée cultivée et consommée en salade."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Barbarea verna",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbarea_verna",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 62165258,
      "text": "Barbarea verna é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Brassicaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Selada kering",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Selada_kering",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29729001,
      "text": "Barbarea verna adalah ramuan dua tahunan dalam keluarga Brassicaceae. Nama-nama umum termasuk selada tanah, selada Amerika, selada sungai, selada kayu hitam, selada Belle Isle, selada , selada kering, selada kuning , selada kudis, selada hijau, dan selada dataran tinggi. Tanaman ini berasal dari Eropa Selatan dan Asia Barat, dan dinaturalisasi di tempat lain Tanaman ini telah dibudidayakan sebagai sayuran daun di Inggris sejak abad ke-17. Karena membutuhkan lebih sedikit air dibandingkan selada air, selada air lebih mudah dibudidayakan."
    }
  },
